<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2294_8743.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser fründtlich willig dienst unnd was wir ehren
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd guots <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoegend</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuvor</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">From</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Fuersichtig</unclear>
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ehrsam</unclear> Wyß, insonnders guot fründt unnd gethrüw
<lb n="4"/>lieb <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear></orgName>. Es habent unnser lieb <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydt</unclear>: und
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Pündtsgnoßen</unclear></orgName> inn den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Pündten</unclear> unns durch iren ab-
<lb n="6"/>gesandten <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Haubtmann</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Paußgen</unclear></persName> so wol <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mündtlich</unclear>, als
<lb n="7"/>durch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eine</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuogestelte</unclear> sonderbare instruction schrifft-
<lb n="8"/>lich berichten laßen, inn was <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gefahren</unclear> unnd sorg-
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">en</unclear> sy sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dißer</unclear> zyt nochmaln befindint, das durch
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitel</unclear> der Spanischen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Meilandischen</unclear> capitulation unnd
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pündtnuß</unclear>, so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jetziger</unclear> zyt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">by</unclear> inen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnder</unclear> dem für-
<lb n="12"/>wand und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schyn</unclear> der restitution unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">widerinhendigung</unclear>
<lb n="13"/>irer <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verlornen</unclear> landen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abermaln</unclear> starck <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getriben</unclear> werde,
<lb n="14"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">widrigen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fhal</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">betröuwenden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ferneren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gwalts</unclear>,
<lb n="15"/>nit allein die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">päß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">irer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lannden</unclear> inn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">frömbden</unclear> Spanisch-
<lb n="16"/>en gwalt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">koemen</unclear>, sonnder auch sy sambt allen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">annderen</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>Evangelischen fryen stenden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hiedurch</unclear> inn ußerste ge-
<lb n="18"/>fahr <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemeiner</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">underthruckung</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verlierung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">so</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thür</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erworbenen</unclear> fryheiten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gerathen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moechten</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Deme</unclear>
<lb n="20"/>nun sy die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guothertzigen</unclear> inn den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Pündten</unclear> sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bests</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoegens</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zewidersetzen</unclear> unnd die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemeine</unclear> fryheit
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürer</unclear> erhalten zehelffen, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hiezuo</unclear> umb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mehrer</unclear> ver-
<lb n="23"/>sicherung willen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">drü</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fryfahnen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uffzerichten</unclear> nochmaln ge-
<lb n="24"/>sinnet und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">entschloßen</unclear>. Wyl aber die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnderhalt</unclear>-
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">derselben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> ohne <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anderer</unclear> fryger stenden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stür</unclear>
<lb n="26"/>unnd hilff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zeschwer</unclear> unnd unmöglich syn wölle, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Syge</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> ir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bitt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> inen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hiezuo</unclear> nit allein für
<lb n="28"/>unns selbs verhilfflich, sonnders auch gegen üch und
<lb n="29"/>den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üwerigen</unclear> die von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbarschafft</unclear> wegen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hieby</unclear> auch
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonderlich</unclear> interessiert, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befündersamb</unclear> syn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wölten</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Und</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2294_8744.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wann</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nun</unclear> wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> allem dem so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> unnseren lieben
