<lb n="33"/>erhaltung ires fryen standts <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zeguetem</unclear> gereichen mag,
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">füro</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geneigt</unclear> sind. So gelangt demnach an üch
<lb n="35"/>unnser lieb <orgName resp="#ner">Eidtgnossen</orgName> unnser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ersuochen</unclear>
<lb n="36"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">biten</unclear> ir wellind sy inn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diserm</unclear> irem anlig-
<lb n="37"/>en günstig unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">für</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevolchen</unclear> haben, unnd
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> für üch selbs unnd durch die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üwerigen</unclear> so hier-
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> fry: und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guetwillig</unclear> weren, üwerer glegenheit nach,
<lb n="40"/>inn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geheimbd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> stür und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">handtreichung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begegnen</unclear> und
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zehilff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khomen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">helffen</unclear> unnd üch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hierunder</unclear> solcher best-
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">en</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">maßen</unclear> erzeigen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> üch unnser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guetes</unclear> ver-
<lb n="43"/>thruwen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stadt</unclear>, unnd darby nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zwyfflend</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dan</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">das</unclear>
<lb n="44"/>ir diß von unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guetem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermercken</unclear>, und üch nach
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebür</unclear> und glegenheit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">züverhalten</unclear> wol <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wüssen</unclear> werd-
